    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Muranishi's chain grows at breakneck speed, reaching its thirty-eighth branch in Sapporo. Inside the new shop, Kitamori and freshly promoted manager Tayama welcome customers while Muranishi cheers Tayama on. Let's listen to the Japanese first without worrying about every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうもありがとうございました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "次のお二人様、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "どうも、いらっしゃいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "この辺でいいですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "うん、いいんじゃないか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "頼むよ、田山店長。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "たくさん売って利益あげてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "頑張ります！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "今、オープン記念で新作が割引になってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "よかったらどうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "すぐ入れますから！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "This short scene is packed with real-world Japanese shop greetings and workplace encouragement. Let's hear each piece up close.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうもありがとうございました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "次のお二人様、どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next party of two, please come ahead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
