      "t": "どうも、いらっしゃいませ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, welcome to our store.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "この辺でいいですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are these alright around here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "頼むよ、田山店長。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am counting on you, Manager Tayama.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "たくさん売って利益あげてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sell plenty and bring up the profits.'",
      "gap": 0.45
