      "t": "'I will do my very best!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "今、オープン記念で新作が割引になってます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now, new releases are discounted for our grand opening.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "tayama",
      "t": "よかったらどうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please take a look if you like.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
